## Project Code

TopoFormer project code (files under `topoformer/`, `scripts/`, `notebooks/`,
`Backbone/` and all other source files unless noted otherwise) may be used for
academic research purposes, provided that:

1. Appropriate credit is given to the TopoFormer paper and this repository.
2. Any redistribution of modified or unmodified source code maintains
   this copyright notice and the notices of any upstream licenses embedded
   within the code.

**This license does not grant permission to use the DINOv3 pretrained
checkpoints or ConvNeXt V2 pretrained weights for commercial purposes.
Those checkpoints are governed by their respective upstream licenses
(Meta DINOv3 License and ConvNeXt V2 License respectively).**

For a full reproduction of the published experimental results, also obtain
the required pretrained weights from their official sources and comply with
their distribution terms.

## DINOv3 (Backbone/)

The DINOv3 code included in this repository under `Backbone/dinov3/`
is governed by the **DINOv3 License Agreement** (see
`Backbone/dinov3/dinov3/LICENSE.md`). Summary: for the specific terms
governing use of the DINOv3 model weights, see the official
[DINOv3 License Agreement](https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3/blob/main/LICENSE).

## ConvNeXt V2

The ConvNeXt V2 encoder used by this project is governed by the
[ConvNeXt V2 license](https://github.com/facebookresearch/ConvNeXt-V2/blob/main/LICENSE).

## GUDHI

Topological data analysis relies on GUDHI, licensed under the
[GUDHI Open Source License](https://gudhi.inria.fr/licensing/) (GNU GPL v3+).

## Benchmark Datasets

All benchmark datasets used in this work (DeepHisto, NCT-CRC-HE-100K,
